#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:311
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e.g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Vaikimisi riigikoodi kasutatakse numbrite puhul, millel puudub suunakood (nt +358).\n"
"\n"
"Kui jätad tühjaks, proovib süsteem seda ise SIM-kaardilt või võrgust leida.\n"
"\n"
"Saad selle siin ise määrata, sisestades 2-kohalise koodi (nt EE, FI) või suunakoodi (nt +372, 372)."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:332
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system tone."
msgstr ""
"Ooteheli on see, mida kuuleid (tuut-tuut-tuut) kõnet oodates. Mõned operaatorid seda ei paku, seega saad selle siit ise sisse lülitada.\n"
"\n"
"Saad valida oma muusikafaili või jätta tavalise süsteemiheli."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:352
msgid "Select Ringback Tone"
msgstr "Vali ootetoon"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:360
msgid "Audio Files"
msgstr "Helifailid"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:386
msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"Vali siit aadressiraamatud, mida Telephonyga kasutada, ja pane need "
"järjekorda. Kõige ülemisel on suurim prioriteet ja seda eelistatakse, kui "
"number on mitmes raamatus. Võid kasutada allpool olevat duplikaatide "
"lahendajat, see teeb kasutuskogemuse palju paremaks."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:405
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"Kui see on sees ja sama number helistab sulle 5 minuti jooksul 3 korda, "
"hakkab kolmas kõne (ja järgmised) helisema täisvaljusega, isegi kui telefon "
"on hääletu peal."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:417
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"Vali kontaktid, kelle teavitused kostuvad alati täisvaljusega, isegi kui "
"telefon on hääletul režiimil või 'mitte segada' olekus."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:438
